@LH_Pets_HostAddress = http://localhost:5100

### Lista clientes
GET {{LH_Pets_HostAddress}}/api/clientes

### Cadastra cliente
POST {{LH_Pets_HostAddress}}/api/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria da Silva",
  "cpf": "123.456.789-00",
  "email": "maria@example.com"
}

### Lista pets
GET {{LH_Pets_HostAddress}}/api/pets

### Cadastra pet vinculado ao cliente 1
POST {{LH_Pets_HostAddress}}/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Rex",
  "especie": "Cachorro",
  "raca": "Labrador",
  "clienteId": 1
}

### Lista pets do cliente 1
GET {{LH_Pets_HostAddress}}/api/pets/cliente/1
